 -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
 This is a log of changes that ncurses has gone through since Zeyd started
@@ -46,6 +46,15 @@
 Changes through 1.9.9e did not credit all contributions;
 it is not possible to add this information.
 
+20260801
+	+ use ansi+csr in aaa+dec -TD
+	+ use ansi+idc in hurd, tw100, vt420 -TD
+	+ use ansi+erase in tw100 -TD
+	+ add vt100+tabs -TD
+	+ fix unbounded recursion in winsch if given a parameter which is not a
+	  valid character in the current encoding (report/analysis by Serhiy
+	  Storchaka).
+
 20260725
 	+ use ansi+cpr in beterm -TD
 	+ use ansi+csr in aixterm, att6386, hirez100, iris-ansi -TD
